      "writtenOn": "2023-09-06T10:09:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checking penalty box and happy box should be simple, right? The information is already available to isUidBlockedByFirewallChains as other bits in |uidMatch|. so it should be easy to do just by passing the isNetworkMetered boolean down to isUidBlockedByFirewallChains.\n\nBut... what\u0027s the plan for data saver? At the moment it looks like only NetworkPolicyManagerService and netd know whether data saver is enabled or not. I\u0027m not sure where we would get this information from.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6183,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 6184,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "a0ba3282295dee976b088aa7cb2cb8e5944ce771",
